-- The customer Case record (Wave 6, OP:116; SPINE-CONTRACT 1.2; OPUS decision 2).
--
-- The name sorts after 20261013100000_commitment_record, and the tenant tables
-- created here are policed by this file's own RLS block below
-- (rlsMigrationOrder.test.ts checks that). The CREATE TABLE, index and foreign
-- key statements are generated by `prisma migrate diff`; everything below the
-- line of hand-written SQL is an invariant Prisma cannot express, and each one
-- must hold for every writer, not only for the domain.

